I'm in a middle of moving, so my library was in crates. Now that I've 
erected my bookcase I started to fill it and found my AD&D 1st edition 
Monster Manual 4th edition August 1979.

SHRIEKER

Shriekers are normally quiet, mindless fungus which are ambulatory. They 
live in dark places beneath the ground. Light within 30' or movement 
within 10' will cause them to emit a piercing shriek, which lasts for 
1-3 melee rounds. This noise has a 50% chance of attracting wondering 
monsters each round thereafter. Purple worms and shambling mounds 
greatly prize shrieker as food.

